        "description_bEaA3n": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description_text": "<p>We are innovators. Whether you’re a contractor in need of new equipment or an organization seeking a qualified team to bring your plans to reality, EZG has your back. Starting from the need for more efficient masonry equipment, our portfolio has exploded to contain equipment in the fencing, hardscape, precast/refractory and contractor manufacturing markets.</p><p>By employing state-of-the-art manufacturing equipment, we design and construct all of our equipment and customer projects to ensure they exceed expectations.</p>"
          }
