          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Improving profitability and efficiencies for contractors since 1998.",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "description": "<p>EZG Manufacturing started as EZ Grout and was born from the desire of one man to improve the quality of masonry equipment. In 1998, founder and CEO Damian Lang sought to help contractors increase efficiency and profitability with American made products built from hands-on experience. Masonry equipment available at the time lacked sturdiness and reliability, causing operators to experience systemic machine clogs and mechanical failures.</p><p>Damian developed the first Grout Hog® after numerous prototypes. Over time, he perfected models by patenting new features specific only to the EZ Grout line, like clog-prevention mechanisms and an innovative delivery system.</p>",
